{"path":"atomic/ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT","title":"ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT","titleHtml":"ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/atomic/ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT","section":"atomic","kind":"page","summary":"Expands to an initializer that can be used to initialize atomic_flag type to the clear state. The value of an atomic_flag that is not initialized using this macro is indeterminate.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread#Atomic_operations\"><code>&lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT /* unspecified */</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Expands to an initializer that can be used to initialize <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/atomic_flag\">atomic_flag</a></span> type to the clear state. The value of an <code>atomic_flag</code> that is not initialized using this macro is indeterminate.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdatomic.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/w/c/atomic/atomic_flag\"><span class=\"kw917\">atomic_flag</span></a> flag <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17.1/3 ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT (p: 200)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17.8/4 ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT (p: 208)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17.1/3 ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT (p: 273)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.17.8/4 ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT (p: 285)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/ATOMIC_VAR_INIT\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ATOMIC_VAR_INIT</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-deprecated-c17\">(deprecated in C17)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c23\">(removed in C23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  initializes a new atomic object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/atomic/atomic_flag\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>atomic_flag</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  lock-free atomic boolean flag <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(struct)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"atomic","title":"Atomic operations library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Expands to an initializer that can be used to initialize atomic_flag type to the clear state."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"References"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"ATOMIC_VAR_INIT","note":"initializes a new atomic object"},{"label":"atomic_flag","note":"lock-free atomic boolean flag